---
import { sitePath } from '../utils/site-path';
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import HoursStatus from '../components/HoursStatus.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Contact | MSD Autos" description="Contact MSD Autos about vehicles, rental or service." active="/contact/">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero--dark"><div class="wrap"><p class="breadcrumbs"><a href={sitePath('/')}>Home</a> / Contact</p><p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p><h1>Contact MSD Autos.</h1><p class="lead">Choose a location or contact channel.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="selected-vehicle" id="selected-vehicle" hidden role="status" aria-live="polite"><div><p class="eyebrow">Vehicle enquiry</p><strong id="selected-vehicle-name"></strong><p>Call MSD Autos and mention this vehicle to the team.</p></div><a class="btn" href="tel:+34604400244">Call about this car <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div><div class="contact-locations">
    <article class="contact-location contact-location--primary"><p class="eyebrow">Vehicle sales · MSD Autos</p><h2>Visit the dealership.</h2><p class="contact-address">Av. de las Habaneras, 101<br/>03182 Torrevieja, Alicante, Spain</p><HoursStatus/><a class="contact-phone" href="tel:+34604400244">+34 604 40 02 44</a><p class="muted">Public sales contact · call to confirm availability before travelling.</p><div class="contact-actions"><a class="btn" href="tel:+34604400244">Call MSD Autos <span class="arrow">↗</span></a><a class="btn btn--outline" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=MSD+Autos+Av.+de+las+Habaneras+101+03182+Torrevieja" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Directions ↗</a></div>
      <div class="contact-links"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/msd.autos/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram @msd.autos ↗</a><a href="https://www.milanuncios.com/tiendas-profesionales/msd-autos-222741?utm_medium=social-media&utm_source=general&utm_campaign=send_friend-profile" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">All cars for sale · Milanuncios ↗</a><a href="https://www.coches.net/concesionario/msdautos/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Also on Coches.net ↗</a></div>
    </article>
    <article class="contact-location"><p class="eyebrow">Workshop · Automoción REACTOR</p><h2>Service location.</h2><p class="contact-address">C. Josefa Rebollo Rodriguez, 23<br/>03183 Torrevieja, Alicante, Spain</p><HoursStatus/><p>The dossier lists two different public workshop phone numbers. Confirm which is current before visiting.</p><div class="contact-phone-list"><a href="tel:+34699000033">+34 699 00 00 33 <small>Current public listing</small></a><a href="tel:+34654392190">+34 654 39 21 90 <small>Other local listing</small></a></div><a class="btn btn--dark" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Automocion+Reactor+C.+Josefa+Rebollo+Rodriguez+23+03183+Torrevieja" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Workshop directions ↗</a></article>
  </div><p class="contact-source-note">The Milanuncios profile has a WhatsApp button for sharing the profile. It does not expose a direct WhatsApp number for MSD Autos, so this page links to the confirmed sales phone and active inventory instead. Rental-specific contact details are also unconfirmed.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
<script>
  const vehicle = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('vehicle');
  const notice = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#selected-vehicle');
  const name = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#selected-vehicle-name');
  if (vehicle && notice && name) { name.textContent = vehicle; notice.hidden = false; }
</script>
